  "presentation_summary": [
    "One week of high-grade fever, dry cough, shortness of breath, arthralgias, and painful swelling in hands and feet with morning stiffness",
    "Initial examination showed fever 101.8 F, tachycardia 103/min, tachypnea 20/min",
    "Laboratory workup showed leukopenia/lymphopenia, anemia, elevated ESR/CRP, low C3/C4, positive ANA, anti-dsDNA 1:160, and anti-SSA positivity",
    "Day 5 deterioration with oxygen saturation 84% on room air and new bilateral multifocal airspace opacities",
    "Extensive infectious workup including sputum cultures, blood cultures, SARS-CoV-2, HIV, CMV, EBV, hepatitis, Legionella, Streptococcus urine antigen, Mycoplasma, QuantiFERON TB, and respiratory viral testing was negative",
    "Fever, tachypnea, hypoxia, cough, and arthralgias resolved within 24 h of IV methylprednisolone"
  ],
